<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFRICA REVENUE BODY FLOODED WITH JOB APPLICATIONS.</title>
<headline>SAFRICA REVENUE BODY FLOODED WITH JOB APPLICATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Around 80,000 applications had been received for 1,082 vacant posts in the South African Revenue Service, the service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Of the posts advertised, 693 were at entry level and 389 at the different promotion levels, the SARS said in a statement.</p>
<p>Successful applicants would be notified by December 31 of their appointments, it said.</p>
<p>South Africa this year amalgamated inland revenue and customs and excise under the new SARS in a bid to boost efficiency.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
